\fBocpf\-post replenish observe\fR
Collect bounded source revisions independently of inventory pressure. Consequence: LOCAL_STATE_WRITE. Safe inspection: omit --apply. Saved observations and pending evidence do not create campaigns or advance consumed-event cursors.
