\fBocpf\-post portfolio volume\-audit\fR
Compare one local day of durable schedules with receipt\-backed publication effects and adjacent\-day volume. Consequence: READ_ONLY. Local ledgers only. No provider call, refill, reservation, replay or causal claim; non-published schedule outcomes remain explicit.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post replenish recover\-generated\fR
Preview or recover reviewed legacy generated copy as fresh successor inventory. Consequence: FUTURE_CONSEQUENCE. Safe inspection: omit --apply. Apply requires the exact review_sha256 from a fresh preview. Creates successor COPY-READY inventory with fresh scoped admission only; never rewrites legacy manifests, schedules posts or calls a social provider.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post replenish refresh\fR
Admit saved source evidence per destination within inventory budgets. Consequence: FUTURE_CONSEQUENCE. Safe inspection: omit --apply. --apply consumes saved fresh observations per destination without GitHub reads or expiry renewal. Observed and consumed revisions are separate. --project limits admission to one enabled source.
