.TP
\fBocpf\-post runtime reconcile\fR
Preview or safely restore user\-unit paths to the current clean checkout. Consequence: AUTHORITY_CHANGE. Safe inspection: omit --apply.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post runtime upgrade\fR
Preview or switch user\-unit software to one exact locally available Git revision. Consequence: AUTHORITY_CHANGE. Safe inspection: omit --apply. Requires state integrity and an exact review hash; never fetches Git or rolls evidence backwards.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post runtime rollback\fR
Preview or switch software to the previously recorded compatible revision. Consequence: AUTHORITY_CHANGE. Safe inspection: omit --apply. Software rollback only; publication/schedule evidence remains current.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post console\fR
Serve or snapshot the loopback\-only read\-only observability console. Consequence: READ_ONLY.
.TP
\fBocpf\-post help\fR
Discover the complete CLI capability catalogue in text or JSON. Consequence: READ_ONLY.
.SH SAFETY
Published, ambiguous and executing effects are not blind-retry authority. Inspect receipts/readback before any replacement consequence.
.SH DISCOVERY
Run \fBocpf-post help --json\fR for the complete catalogue and parser arguments.
.SH FILES
~/.config/oneclickpostfactory/post-once/ contains local authority/configuration. ~/.local/state/oneclickpostfactory/post-once/ contains durable local evidence by default.
.SH SEE ALSO
ocpf-post help, ocpf-post doctor, ocpf-post health, ocpf-post capabilities, ocpf-post state verify, ocpf-post runtime status
